Original work
-------------

Every file in this repository — the Express server, the SQL layer, the SQLite
and PostgreSQL schemas, the seed data, the hand-written CSS and the browser
ES modules under public/ — was written for this project. No third-party
application code, template, theme, stylesheet, icon set, font or image was
copied in, and no commercial childcare product's name, branding or copy appears
in the source.

Runtime dependencies
--------------------

SproutDesk uses only published npm packages. They are installed by
`npm install` and are not vendored in this repository; each one keeps its own
licence and copyright notice (see the LICENSE file inside its folder under
node_modules/).

| Package | Purpose | Licence |
| --- | --- | --- |
| express | HTTP server and routing | MIT |
| better-sqlite3 | SQLite driver (default engine) | MIT |
| pg | PostgreSQL driver (optional engine) | MIT |
| bcryptjs | password hashing | MIT |
| multer | multipart image uploads | MIT |
| dotenv | .env loading | BSD-2-Clause |

The browser side deliberately has no dependencies: the frontend is plain ES
modules plus one stylesheet, so nothing is bundled or transpiled.

Data
----

`npm run seed` inserts a fictional demo centre (children, guardians, staff,
invoices). Those names, addresses, phone numbers and notes are invented
placeholders for development, not real people. Replace or delete them before
using the application with real families.
